target/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.zss.bak

# The daemon's LIVE config, not the template. config.rs reads "maschine.json"
# relative to its working directory, which the systemd unit points at daemon/,
# so install.sh copies system/maschine.json there ONCE and never again - a
# hand-edited live config has to survive a reinstall. Committing this copy
# would publish one machine's settings; worse, if main ever tracked the path a
# pull on the Pi would fail on the untracked file, and the obvious unblock is
# deleting it - which drops "external_pad_leds" and lets the first pad touch
# destroy the per-group colours.
daemon/maschine.json
notes/
.superpowers/
